 are finally able to open diplomatic channels with the civilization we now know to be the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName].\n\nRemarkably, they appear to completely lack the concept of individuality that is inherent in the [This.Owner.GetSpeciesAdj] species. Indeed, the individual [This.ContactCountry.GetAdj] \"[This.ContactCountry.GetIndividualName]\" has no free will or thought whatsoever and is a mere pawn of the \"[This.ContactCountry.GetGovernmentName]\". Far from chafing under such tight control, our [This.Owner.GetResearchers] speculate that the [This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural] have evolved to depend on this collective intelligence and would not be able to survive without it."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/36528f0917466f66e520.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"first_contact.103.A","label":{"zh":"我们应该研究他们——把从他们那学到的这套用在我们自己的工人上！","en":"We should study them - and apply the findings to our own workers!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":false,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}},{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"met_hive_mind","path":"owner","value":false}]],"allow":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_egalitarian","value":false,"label":{"zh":"平等主义","en":"Egalitarian"}}]]},{"key":"first_contact.103.B","label":{"zh":"有意思的物种。我们必须进一步研究这样一个物种是怎样的。","en":"A fascinating species. We must find out how such a phenomenon is possible."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":false,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}},{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"met_hive_mind","path":"owner","value":false}]]},{"key":"first_contact.103.C1","label":{"zh":"我们会把他们清理干净。","en":"We will wipe them out."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":true,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en"