e aliens are a hive mind. Options: study them (modifier), find them fascinating (research bonus), xenophobes vow to wipe them out, repeat meetings only get the plain option.\n\n## 分支与结局 Branches and outcomes\n\n各选项互斥，由本方伦理与 met_hive_mind 标记决定。/ Options are mutually exclusive by ethics and the met_hive_mind flag.\n\n## 条件与文明差异 Conditions and variants\n\n选项全部取决于排外/平等主义/灭绝倾向。/ All options depend on ethics.\n\n## 审阅记录 Review notes\n\n- 已核对 Checked：脚本、通用收尾阶段、选项条件。/ Script, generic end stages, option conditions.\n- 审阅改动 Changes：无结构改动。/ No structural change.\n","path":"summaries/event-first-contact-103.md"}}